   "source": [
    "# Alternative Document Extraction Methods\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook demonstrates various extraction methods for documents that are difficult to parse with standard text extraction but can be filled neatly (like I-9 forms).\n",
    "\n",
    "## Methods Covered:\n",
    "1. **OCR-Based Extraction** - Using Tesseract for visual text recognition\n",
    "2. **Template-Based Extraction** - Using predefined coordinate templates\n",
    "3. **Pattern-Matching Extraction** - Advanced regex patterns for structured data\n",
    "4. **Computer Vision Extraction** - Using OpenCV for form field detection\n",
    "5. **Hybrid Approach** - Combining multiple methods for best results"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
